/* Experiment 249 -- SIAM 100-Digit Challenge holdout B for App. D Problem 14 (Maxima column).
   Every case is a finite-element boundary-value solve; Maxima has no PDE
   solver, so all rows are SKIP (as in exp. 189).  See fem_parameter.m. */
load("../harness.mac")$
load("../siam100_common.mac")$
for t in ["machine", "wp50"] do for k : 1 thru 10 do skip(sconcat("bd14.", k, " ", t), "NDSolveValue (FEM)")$
quit()$
